title: "BET-XRD Morphology Analyzer: Scientific Edition for Journal Publication"
version: 3.0.0
doi: ""
date-released: 2026-12-01
url: "https://github.com/badreddinemansouri-eng/BET-XRD-analyzer-USCR-MSPAG"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - BET surface area
  - XRD analysis
  - physisorption
  - crystallography
  - porous materials
  - nanocrystalline materials
  - Williamson-Hall
  - Scherrer
  - BJH pore size distribution
  - IUPAC
abstract: >
  An open-source web application for IUPAC-compliant physisorption analysis
  and advanced X-ray diffraction characterization. Integrates BET surface area
  determination, BJH pore size distribution, Scherrer crystallite size,
  Williamson-Hall size-strain separation, and automated phase identification
  against COD, Materials Project, and OPTIMADE-compliant databases. Produces
  publication-quality figures with embedded citations and machine-readable
  reports suitable for journal submission.
